id: pm-gh1624
title: "GH-1624: define typed Unicode handling for extension output across JSON and TOON"
description: "GitHub report https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1624 describes an unpaired UTF-16 surrogate from extension output causing an untyped TOON TypeError while JSON succeeds. Reproduce through the public host command boundary, then define consistent field-aware refusal or explicitly documented normalization and a reusable SDK primitive. This concerns already-malformed external output, distinct from completed persisted-input validation and valid-pair compaction fixes."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
