author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: Reproduce nested values and object keys through the actual extension host on Node and Bun; Preserve valid astral pairs and input immutability; Publish the SDK contract and JSON/TOON parity with pre-fix negative controls
parent: pm-5t33or
risk: medium
confidence: medium
expected_result: "Extension output has a documented consistent Unicode policy and actionable typed diagnostics across formats, while valid sibling data and valid surrogate pairs are preserved according to that policy."
