  "2026-10-29T14:47:42.900Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete live 3153-item all-status corpus has zero unreadable records and zero omissions; fresh request-specific search and open/in_progress lists found no GH1624 owner. Full live metadata, comments and history of pm-gh1478 and pm-jsm9im confirm their completed narrower scopes. New report is recorded open and unclaimed while PR1623 finishes."
  "2026-10-29T17:33:36.945Z","harness:codex","Begin extension-output Unicode contract implementation in an isolated checkout while PR1623 completes checks. Reuse existing persisted-text and valid-pair compaction lineage; preserve typed field diagnostics, valid astral pairs and input immutability across JSON and TOON."
  "2026-10-29T17:40:48.450Z","harness:codex",Independent clean pre-fix checkout runs the corrected real extension fixture on Node and Bun; both fail because JSON exits successfully for malformed output. The original fixture setup omission was corrected before this counterfactual and is not counted as defect evidence. Typed rejection preserves valid pairs and input; public helpers expose deliberate boundary normalization and output validation.
  "2026-10-29T17:44:41.196Z","harness:codex","Focused final cohort passes304 tests across23 files including Node/Bun host probes, Unicode policy unit cases and existing telemetry/Sentry contracts. The formatter refuses malformed strings and keys consistently; the normalization helper only changes lone surrogate code units. Full coverage and package/surface/static verification are underway in the isolated checkout."
